/**
 * Unit tests for the `--diagnose` dump reader.
 *
 * The dump text is generated by calling the REAL formatter
 * (`formatFSE26Diagnostic`) rather than by pasting a copy of its output. A
 * pasted fixture would only prove that this parser agrees with a snapshot of
 * the format; driving the producer means a format change fails here instead of
 * silently parsing nothing in production.
 *
 * @module benchmarks/__tests__/fse26-diagnose-analyze
 */

